@title: An action that asks the server first is waited for until the page shows the answer
# expect-output: products=[2 in Manuls]
# expect-output: total=[24.50]
# expect-output: price=[$24.50]
STEP 1: Enter asks the server, and the address changes when it answers
    NAVIGATE to @SITE@/spa_late.html
    FILL 'Search' field with 'manul'
    PRESS ENTER
    EXTRACT the 'Products' into {products}
    PRINT "products=[{products}]"
STEP 2: A click that only asks the server leaves the address where it was
    CLICK the 'Add to cart' button
    EXTRACT the 'Cart total' into {total}
    PRINT "total=[{total}]"
STEP 3: A click that asks the server, then goes to another page
    CLICK the 'Check out' button
    EXTRACT the 'Price' into {price}
    PRINT "price=[{price}]"
DONE.
